{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdaff02f974b057af59f57ece3b5a6ccdb7e261f2fd86d9aa3a9473775340cac",
      "text": "今天大家嗓子状态都很好呢！\n感觉比上次歌声更有延展性了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70c1a6951ed2382bf954ba9f32122cbc8ac9ed8498b86324977c26e664dffac4",
      "text": "真、真的吗！？俺的歌多亏了发声练习，\n也稍微有点偶像的样子了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64952b4b9d5d5b98f45aab977480466d62767ec83eba1b40718595bd1d5478eb",
      "text": "（F-LAGS的各位，进步真是神速！\n照这个状态下去……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f533dd6f0791f46852021faed9ef4da77daedb17c7e329e3b068989226438882",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー！\n现在能耽误一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18ddd3ec13da361b437220ce16e16248d0e1127ce4b713520e661bdd7eddb6fc",
      "text": "贤君，辛苦了。发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:062373f0f0911a334dbc1ac7ef04def719bc6d9f93edcdde8dec712d9b4f238b",
      "text": "其实是有一份新工作的邀约！\n具体是这样的内容……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c7ee785502a64a1e3c62514aa4655f06d0f61c6fd83ccdc640a98b2da4db6a8",
      "text": "……原来如此，是音乐节目的出演邀请啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fddc5dfb75961bc17eac66465ec91d89b8daa70f6b875c1e7099ccd8a807f9d8",
      "text": "是的。而且不是普通的音乐节目，而是从我\n小时候起就一直在播的长寿节目呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93096a4ac32fd6fa31cf2a9ea05ba16b2fb67cdd006dc872a3d8f3d731020866",
      "text": "我看看，资料上写着“想向出演的偶像\n多方了解一下前职的经历”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eedc13b994cb96d57dd3b711fc40b389289bd1900bf8dd41559b49ae6d479c8",
      "text": "果然“有前职的偶像”，\n很有话题度呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0a51c376998b6949f8a95a0fe1e5cc0756a28b7f58b045785f7fe697005d3f5",
      "text": "……说起来，之前社长也说过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ced0d4edfb461087030d75324e39304b26f22fd4e85edc674cf3562fc67c0071",
      "text": "正因为315 Production的偶像\n全员都有着形形色色的过去，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fab4b70a1f93bce0c2b8aa03f81f22635576b3dee8f8c19bfd85a8de81dfe5f5",
      "text": "才能作为偶像、作为人闪闪发光，\n为大家带来耀眼的光芒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad5f4b39fca46b38b80743916e91d56a68ddacb05abd0ffa8c4eac2e89896b73",
      "text": "这份工作正是向更多人传递偶像们所拥有的\n光芒的好机会呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
